        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The undead viciously attack enemies within their squares or within 5 feet (@Check[type:reflex|dc:23|basic:true] save). Up to three actions can be used when performing this activity, and its effects depend on the number of actions used.</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">1</span>: @Damage[5d6[bludgeoning]] damage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">2</span>: @Damage[7d6[bludgeoning]] damage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"pf2-icon\">3</span>: @Damage[7d6[bludgeoning]] damage and an affected creature is grabbed by the Mixed Undead Swarm.</p>"
        },
